    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_woven_fabrics_apparel; processing_state=manufactured): Named textile/apparel article (woollens, moccasins, mittens, wrought inkle = linen tape per Simmonds 1892 s.v. INKLE, floorcloth) left in the residual bin. Layer-1 observations: 3 rows, 1800–1800. Series: KEW_CUST 5 ×3. Units: Lbs. (Pounds) ×3. Top routes: Holland → United Kingdom ×1; World → United Kingdom ×1; Germany → United Kingdom ×1."@en ;
